  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">3.GAVI- Globala vaccinalliansen st&#xF6;der fattiga l&#xE4;nders anstr&#xE4;ngningar att vaccinera sin befolkning. Det totala st&#xF6;det GAVI givit till 73 l&#xE4;nder (som har en BNI/capita mindre &#xE4;n USD1000)under perioden 2000-2006 &#xE4;r ca USD 962 miljoner. Sveriges st&#xF6;d till alliansen &#xE4;r 300 MSEK under 2006-2008. Det &#xE4;r ber&#xE4;knat GAVI bidragit till att f&#xF6;rhindra 2,3 milj framtida d&#xF6;dsfall. Ytterl 10 milj liv ber&#xE4;kn</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GAVI- Global Vaccin Alliance support poor coutnries efforts to immunize its people. GAVI&apos;s total support to 73 countries 2000-2006 is appr MUSD 962. Sweden&apos;s support to GAVI is 300 MSEK 2006-2008 (100 MSEK each year). It&apos;s estimated that GAVI has contributed to prevent 2,3 millon future deaths. An additionl 10 million lives are expected to be saved during 2006-2015.</narrative>
  </description>
